    "updated_at": "2019-12-12T13:25:19Z",
    "body": "1. I think we should use the Reporting API infrastructure, though the amended Reporting API as agreed upon at the last TPAC. Not sure what the status of that is. @clelland @yoavweiss?\r\n2. I'm not sure I understand why or how `respondWith()` would be blocked. (I've seen the discussion for `match()`/`matchAll()` at https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1490.)\r\n3. If you point to a same-origin resource that redirects to a cross-origin resource without CORP, what URL ends up being reported? (Note https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#atomic-http-redirect-handling.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
