    "body": "Okay, so you want to distinguish between the service worker handing you a faulty response and the server handing you a faulty response, but no changes to `respondWith()` itself are planned? I guess that would help debugging, though architecturally it doesn't seem great to expose the existence of service workers.\r\n\r\ncc @jakearchibald ",
