    "body": "I updated [the gist](https://gist.github.com/yutakahirano/f14f15bd1595e1e913b0870649000470). PTAL.\r\n - It now uses https://w3c.github.io/reporting/. \r\n - It now explicitly modifies the CORP check and nested navigation steps, assuming we call the CORP check in Cache.match (see https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/1490).",
